    "## 5. One feasibility check: how fast does the signal turn over?\n",
    "\n",
    "Costs are decided by turnover, and turnover is governed by how much the ranking\n",
    "changes month to month. We measure the month-over-month rank autocorrelation of\n",
    "the signal: a high autocorrelation means this month's ranking is largely last month's\n",
    "ranking, so we trade little."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f1d160a6",
   "metadata": {
    "papermill": {
     "duration": 0.001467,
