     "exception": false,
     "start_time": "2026-09-10T18:57:00.465342+00:00",
     "status": "completed"
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "The Spearman rank correlation is the Pearson correlation of the ranks. Each pair of\n",
    "adjacent months is joined on the symbols present in both, kept only where at least\n",
    "`MIN_NAMES` symbols survive the join, and the per-pair correlations are averaged."
   ]
  },
